+/// The store `smysl check` reads when it is given no path and no `--store`.
+const DEFAULT_STORE: &str = ".smysl/store";
+
 /// `smysl check` - run the check pipeline (§23.1).
 ///
+/// With no path it checks `.smysl/store`, relative to the directory it is run from. Stdin is
